    '黄美兰的摊位开始一周休息几天。清早到了食阁，常常不知道该坐哪里、等谁。':'Huang Meilan’s stall now closes a few days a week. Arriving at the hawker centre early, there is often no knowing where to sit or whom to wait for.',
    '早上去食阁，现在和以前有什么不一样？':'How are mornings at the hawker centre different from before?',
